      "type": "file",
      "name": "service.rs",
      "filePath": "src-tauri/src/pairing/service.rs",
      "summary": "Central trusted-device orchestration service wiring identity, trust store, signed offers, the fingerprint broker, and the iroh transport together: shows/redeems pair codes, sends and receives file offers, and surfaces accept/decline/paired events to the UI.",
